		{"id":"74e9ccbd0949b7e6","type":"text","text":"**\n\n#### ОСНОВНОЕ ДЕЙСТВИЕ\n[🗲АТАКА](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tci_3JhvJKSt0X3kX726bTb9wF8ZooLH0zARduUdPNo/edit?tab=t.rzl8clms650p#bookmark=id.usvtkqjfnfsh)\n[🗲РЫВОК](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tci_3JhvJKSt0X3kX726bTb9wF8ZooLH0zARduUdPNo/edit?pli=1&tab=t.rzl8clms650p#bookmark=id.9iuy7pl5ln8n)\n[🗲СОЗДАТЬ ЗАКЛИНАНИЕ](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tci_3JhvJKSt0X3kX726bTb9wF8ZooLH0zARduUdPNo/edit?pli=1&tab=t.rzl8clms650p#bookmark=id.m8ebmhz8ytxc)\n[🗲ПРИКАЗ](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tci_3JhvJKSt0X3kX726bTb9wF8ZooLH0zARduUdPNo/edit?pli=1&tab=t.rzl8clms650p#bookmark=id.6wzbnlfp94cr)\n#### МАНЕВР\n[🗲ДВИГАТЬСЯ](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tci_3JhvJKSt0X3kX726bTb9wF8ZooLH0zARduUdPNo/edit?tab=t.rzl8clms650p#bookmark=id.p4eycphvk85n)\n[🗲ПОДГОТОВКА](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tci_3JhvJKSt0X3kX726bTb9wF8ZooLH0zARduUdPNo/edit?tab=t.rzl8clms650p#bookmark=id.o2lnhfijjfqv)\n[🗲СНЯТЬ ЭФФЕКТ](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tci_3JhvJKSt0X3kX726bTb9wF8ZooLH0zARduUdPNo/edit?tab=t.rzl8clms650p#bookmark=id.m5hdqks3ua96)\n[🗲ПОБЕГ](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tci_3JhvJKSt0X3kX726bTb9wF8ZooLH0zARduUdPNo/edit?tab=t.rzl8clms650p#bookmark=id.kk9nrieiyg5u)\n[🗲ВЗАИМОДЕЙСТВИЕ](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tci_3JhvJKSt0X3kX726bTb9wF8ZooLH0zARduUdPNo/edit?tab=t.rzl8clms650p#bookmark=id.ixacsvrh5vda)\n#### ФИНТ\n[🗲ВОССТАНОВЛЕНИЕ](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tci_3JhvJKSt0X3kX726bTb9wF8ZooLH0zARduUdPNo/edit?tab=t.rzl8clms650p#bookmark=id.4y31ax4v5qne)\n[🗲ЗАРЯДКА](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tci_3JhvJKSt0X3kX726bTb9wF8ZooLH0zARduUdPNo/edit?tab=t.rzl8clms650p#bookmark=id.6m5fqvqtqzgu)\n[🗲ИСПОЛЬЗОВАТЬ ПРЕДМЕТ](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tci_3JhvJKSt0X3kX726bTb9wF8ZooLH0zARduUdPNo/edit?tab=t.rzl8clms650p#bookmark=id.2xlhirkfa3pm)\n[🗲ОШЕЛОМИТЬ](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tci_3JhvJKSt0X3kX726bTb9wF8ZooLH0zARduUdPNo/edit?tab=t.rzl8clms650p#bookmark=id.atfvk